<section class="fpg-fo-sec" id="technology"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">What every Först shares</h2><ul class="fpg-fo-feats fpg-fo-feats--3" role="list">
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip8.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip8.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip8.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>FörstGrip feed rollers</h3><p>Twin hydraulic rollers. The top one lifts on an arc and is held down by two heavy springs, so it climbs over butt ends and drags in forks and awkward limbs.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly8.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly8.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly8.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Open-top flywheel</h3><p>The flywheel throws the chip instead of blowing it, with twin blades and rear draught fins. Wet, green material is far less likely to block the chute.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>AutoIntelligence control</h3><p>Sealed electronics that run the no-stress feed, tell you when a service is due and prompt the routine checks. Proof against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
</ul><p class="fpg-fo-lead fpg-fo-lead--after">Först has built chippers in Britain since 2013 and is a Made in Britain member. Machines carry Först’s three-year warranty.</p></div></section>
<section class="fpg-fo-sec fpg-fo-sec--tint" id="parts"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><div class="fpg-fo-duo"><div class="fpg-fo-panel"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">Parts on Först’s own drawings</h2><p>8 machines, 688 part numbers. Pick the machine, click the part on the exploded drawing, and see our price and stock.</p><a class="fpg-fo-btn fpg-fo-btn--dark" href="/pages/fpg-part-finder?brand=16">Open the Först parts finder</a></div><div class="fpg-fo-panel"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">A service kit for every machine</h2><p>Air, oil, fuel and hydraulic filters, plugs and bearings, listed machine by machine with our prices.</p><ul class="fpg-fo-kitlinks" role="list"><li><a href="/products/forst-st6p-wheeled-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">ST6P</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-st6p-hd-wheeled-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">ST6P HD</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-st6d24-wheeled-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">ST6D 24</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-st6d42-wheeled-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">ST6D 42</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-st8d-wheeled-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">ST8D</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-tr6p-tracked-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">TR6P</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-tr6d24-tracked-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">TR6D 24</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-tr6d42-tracked-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">TR6D 42</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-tr8d-tracked-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">TR8D</a></li><li><a href="/products/forst-xr8d-tracked-woodchipper{% if theme.role != 'main' %}?view=forst{% endif %}#service-kit">XR8D</a></li><li><a h